# Two creatures may block a menace creature together. Bot2's two Ornithopters both block the Saboteur; its attack trigger had put a
# +1/+1 counter on one of them (a 1/3), which deals the 1 damage that kills the 4/1 Saboteur: it dies, and the damage it
# dealt in the same step took out the 0/2 Ornithopter (4 damage assigned lethal to each in turn).

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Sunset Saboteur
Swamp x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Island x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sunset Saboteur.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Sunset Saboteur > Bot2)
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter#1)
Bot2.Block(Ornithopter#1 > Sunset Saboteur; Ornithopter#2 > Sunset Saboteur)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Sunset Saboteur
Bot2.Life = 20
